      "id": "pri-04",
      "title": "Platform identity is separate from account role and financial responsibility",
      "summary": "Stripe Accounts v2 uses account configurations and capabilities. Adyen distinguishes processing accounts from legal entities, account holders and balances.",
      "implication": "Modeling implication: Give legal party, capability, balance ownership and loss allocation explicit records; do not map all provider resources to one connected-account label.",
      "priority": "high",
