      "title": "Merchant-of-record selection changes the work the seller owns",
      "summary": "Managed Payments covers eligible digital products with defined transaction and indirect-tax responsibilities and integration restrictions. Paddle offers a different merchant-of-record billing option.",
      "implication": "Modeling implication: Make the merchant-of-record choice explicit in recurring-revenue evaluation; tax calculation, filing and acting as seller are distinct responsibilities.",
